{
  "patient long-range burst": "蓄勢遠程爆發",
  "Standing clear of the fight builds Sightings that his next Plumb Line spends for one heavy long shot. Golden Quill and Plumb Line on the same enemy Triangulate it, pinning it for his heaviest hits. The signature carries a full Plumb Line on from the farthest enemy to the next farthest, three deep.": "遠離戰鬥時，梅里迪安累積觀測，為下一次鉛垂線蓄出強力遠射。金羽筆與鉛垂線命中同一敵人時會三角定位並定住目標，方便重擊。招牌天賦讓蓄滿的遠射從最遠的敵人繼續傳向接下來最遠的兩名敵人。",
  "marks, anti-heal and drain": "標記、減療與汲取",
  "Golden Quill Charts every enemy on its line for the whole fight, and Charted enemies heal less and take more. His first hit on each enemy is a Discovery that writes a Field Note, and his notebook makes him stronger all fight. Final Expedition is the payoff: on Charted enemies it holds longer and drains harder; the signature Inks them so nothing closes their wounds.": "金羽筆會標繪路徑上的敵人，持續整場戰鬥。被標繪的敵人受療更少，承傷更多。首次命中每名敵人都會寫下一條實地筆記，強化梅里迪安。最後的遠征對標繪目標持續更久、汲取更強。招牌天賦用墨標記敵人，使其無法治療。",
  "sustained ramp and endurance": "持久成長與續航",
  "Once Well-Read is at full speed every basic attack adds Stride, and at full Stride his quills fly in a blur. He carries Provisions and eats one when he is hurt; a deep pick turns them into a defensive rest or a forced march. Long fights favour him; the signature makes his hand a blur that throws at three enemies at once, and Push On feeds it.": "博覽群書達到最高速度後，每次普攻都會累積步幅，疊滿後羽筆飛快射出。受傷時消耗一份補給。進階天賦可選擇防禦休整或強行軍。招牌天賦同時攻擊三名敵人，並可透過繼續前進延長。"
}
